| `coopdata:period-reminders-dismissed`         | Ikhumbula tikhumbuto tekubika umsebentisi latisulile                                                  | Lokwangekhatsi | Kuze kucishwe imininingwane ye-browser                            | Lokuhlalako (kugcinwa kwendzawo)        | Kubalulekile (kukhetsa) |
